{
  "source": "Microsoft published national-cloud SharePoint/OneDrive + AAD endpoints (verify live). Region names from Connect-SPOService -Region (AADCrossTenantAuthenticationLocation): Default, ITAR, Germany, China, France.",
  "note": "The SPO admin resource/audience IS the tenant admin URL itself; MSAL requests {resource}/.default. adminUrl/resource are per-tenant: https://{tenant}-admin.<spoSuffix>. authority is the AAD login host for the cloud.",
